  "solution": {
    "text": "In <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ι</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2,</mn></mrow></msub></math><br />let,&nbsp;<math><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mi>t</mi></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>-</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></math> or <math><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></math><br /><math><mo>∴</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ι</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><munderover><mo stretchy=\"false\">∫</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>π</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></munderover><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ι</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mrow></math><br />Also,&nbsp;<math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ι</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></math> &amp; <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ι</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math> are both positive as<br /><math><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><m